<title>USA: US Census cotton use, oilseed reports on Thursday.</title>
<headline>US Census cotton use, oilseed reports on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Census Bureau will release its monthly reports on cotton-mill use and oilseed crush on Thursday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The reports will cover activity during November.</p>
<p>Usually, the reports are released at the end of each month. Release date was changed this month because of the holiday.</p>
